flowchart TD
  R[Rubric + Evidence + Candidate Base Case] --> C[Content-equivalent control]
  R --> T[Single-factor treatment perturbation]
  C --> P[Pair ID + immutable digests]
  T --> P
  P --> B[Block by task, language, risk and expected label]
  B --> L[Counterbalanced order / Latin square]
  L --> S[Fixed seeds and >=3 repetitions]
  S --> V[Strict observation validation]
  V --> E[Paired estimand]
  E --> U[Bootstrap CI + exact McNemar]
  U --> H[Holm correction across probe family]
  H --> Q{Critical violation?}
  Q -- yes --> X[Quarantine recommendation]
  Q -- no --> D[Diagnostic signal / watch / no material signal]
  X --> A[Advisory evidence only]
  D --> A
